window.products.push({"id":746019,"name":"ACHub Premium Fridge Liner, BPA Free, Food Safe - Wider Roll Cut to Fit, Non Adhesive, Washable, Easy to Clean & Durable EVA Shelf Mats - FridgeFresh-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JeVltGYZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Hygenic and Food Stays Fresh LongerThese waterproof fridge shelf liners are the easiest way to help prevent messy spills and grime from overtaking your shelves and drawers. 2. Flexible Dimension and Multiuse in Stylish Translucent DesignOur premium EVA plastic shelf liner comes in a roll of 5-ft or 10-ft with 16-inch width for easy customization to fit shelves, drawers and bins for any refrigerator. These refrigerator mats also work well for freezer racks, cupboard shelves & drawers, utility cabinets, under the sink, pantry shelves. This fridge liner can also be used in pantry, laundry, bathroom & garage. 3. Save Time and MoneyNon-adhesive, long lasting, sturdy, semi-rigid, and anti-tearing. It is strong enough to withstand being removed, washed and put back in-place over and over again! No more spending hours for deep cleaning, simply wash these fridge mats with soapy water, dry and put them back. 4. Safe: Our refrigerator liners are BPA Free, Food Grade Material, Odorless and Non-Toxic. 5. Brief User Guide When using the refrigerator shelf liners for glass shelves, cut to fit the glass part of the shelves and place the bumpy side up for stability and proper air flow under food or containers. Rotate the width around to optimize usage and reduce waste. A few minutes in hot water, dry, then laid on a cool surface would help the ends curling issue. Laying heavy objects or reverse roll would also help. Typically, French-door and side-by-side refrigerators will need a 10-ft roll or more for full coverage, including the crisper drawers, fresh drawers, and door bins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JeVltGYZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACHub","source_asin":"B0C4GRFL67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4GRFL67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4GRFL67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
