window.products.push({"id":746127,"name":"Closet Organizer and Storage Unit. Includes 8 Fabric Storage Bins. DIY Organizer Shelf For Clothes, Toys, Underhanging Closet Storage. Used in Closet,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TuHFWLR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ CLUTTER-FREE CLOSETS! What do houses never have enough of? Closets! and what do closets never have enough of? Space! Sliding right underneath the hanging section of your closets, the Neaterize cube shelf maximizes closet shelving storage capacity! Replete with the chic set of matching bins as shown in the pictures, there is no need to find just the right cubes! Unpack, assemble, and start storing. ⭐ YOU CAN DIY! Easy to install, fun to build! Follow the step-by-step instructions, no skills or tools necessary! Design the layout according to your taste and space, with its many configurations. Enjoy this closet organizer's unique space saving and organizing features. Dimensions: 48.8’’W x 11.8’’D x 25.4’’H Bin Dimensions: Bottom Storage Bins -10.5\" x 12\" x 5.5\"; Upper Storage Bins- 10.5\" x 12\" x 9\" ⭐ MULTI-SIZE, MULTI-PURPOSE! With 2 size cubby shelves, this organizer provides additional closet shelving to store clothes, accessories, shawls, hats, gloves & purses right in the convenience of your bedroom, hallway or closets. Great as a shoe rack, bookshelf or even TV stand, perfect for playroom organization, offices & studies, tidying books, toys, crafts, supplies & whatnot! ⭐ STORE ’N’ STYLE! Exclusively & exquisitely designed, all components are precisely matched. It has got to be the prettiest way to organize! Covered in a sophisticated linen print, The closet organizer comes in 5 chic colors ; soft beige, matte black, dark grey, neutral grey & white grey, enjoy this trendy closet cubicle shelf that enhances any room. ⭐ PILE IT ON! Made to handle the big stuff, this top-quality storage closet organizer won’t disappoint. Each bin is supported by good quality shelves, 4 supportive bars & frame. Protected by durable fabric material that is both water resistant & dustproof, this cubical shelving unit is prepared to weather any storm! RISK FREE PURCHASE! Absolutely love our cube closet storage organizer or reach out to our team for full service- guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TuHFWLR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B09XVP3S14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XVP3S14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XVP3S14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
