window.products.push({"id":746151,"name":"Fully Assembled Sweet 16 Birthday Photo Booth Props - Set of 30 - Teal Blue & Silver Selfie Signs - 16th Party Supplies & Decorations - 16th Bday Desi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XL0Fr3UUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FULLY ASSEMBLED = NO WASTED TIME GLUING THEM TOGETHER 🌟 Your teal blue and silver 16th photo booth props will arrive to you in a sturdy box, already pre-assembled onto thick 9.5 inch wooden sticks. All you have to do is take them out of the box and you’re ready to go! We also include 30 glue dots that are optional to use in case you want to add even more support. We’ve seen many of our customers use the glue dots to add a few of the props to their walls as added party decor! PRETTY DESIGNS MAKE YOUR PARTY AND PHOTOS STAND OUT 🌟 We put a lot of thought into designing each photo prop ourselves to ensure that every sign was super cute and perfect for your sweet 16th birthday. They work well in pictures (of course!), as centerpieces, or wall decor. STURDY CARDSTOCK AND STICKS WILL LAST ALL PARTY LONG 🌟 Our 16 photo booth props are made of 350 gsm card stock, which means they are thick. This high quality means they can hold up to being used all night long (plus they come packaged in a box that you can store them in to re-use for future parties if you'd like). The dowels we used are made of thick quality wood, so they won’t break or fray. SET OF 30 MEANS LOTS OF (CUTE) OPTIONS 🌟 Our large set of 30 props includes plenty of options for everyone to choose from. We didn’t just throw together a bunch of random props out there though. We made sure they all coordinated and included a good mix of sayings, cute hats and glasses, and fun signs/props unique to a 16th birthday! There are so many options that everyone will find plenty they want to use! REAL GLITTER ADDS REAL SPARKLE TO YOUR PARTY 🌟 The real silver glitter that sets us apart from other photo booth kits will set your sixteenth birthday celebration apart too! The no DIY 16th signs save you time and add that extra touch to elevate your party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XL0Fr3UUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Occasion","source_asin":"B09ZWQF191","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746151","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZWQF191","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZWQF191","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":746152,"name":"Command Medium Wire Hooks, White, 2-Hooks, 4-Strips, Organize Damage-Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFDlA6UXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scotch Delicate Surface Painter’s Tape is great for surfaces that require a little extra care such as wood floors, wallpaper, cabinets, painted drywall, and freshly painted walls* (*painted at least 24 hours ago). This delicate surface tape with gentle adhesive can stay on surfaces for up to 60 days and then removes easily without leaving any sticky residue behind. This tape features Edge-Lock Technology that seals out paint to deliver sharp paint lines and clean removal for your more sensitive projects, including accent walls, decorative stripes and patterns. Whether you're protecting your hardwood floors from paint splatter or going all out with a decorative mural, rely on Scotch Delicate Surface Painter's Tape for a professional look that's easy on your surfaces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IFDlA6UXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Command","source_asin":"B001B1VWTA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001B1VWTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001B1VWTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
