window.products.push({"id":746297,"name":"MacKenzie-Childs Courtly Check Enamel Lidded Sugar Bowl, Small Serving Bowl with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":85.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wl8pQGnSL._AC_.jpg","description":"The MacKenzie-Childs Enamel Lidded Sugar Bowl is a versatile addition to your daily serving essentials and collection of decorative bowls for home decor. Taking your lumps becomes a delight with this table accent. This classy bowl with a stylish cover handles serving any spice or sauce with ease.This small decorative bowl has a hand-glazed heavy-gauge steel underbody and a bronzed stainless-steel rim. Decorated in our popular Courtly Check pattern, it features a subtle jewel-toned palette woven by an artisan’s brush through glossy hand-painted checks, making it perfect for pairing with any food or color. Our small enamel serving bowl perfectly matches the other kitchen tools and dishware in our Courtly Check collection, including tea kettles, dinner bowls, serving dishes, plates, and more!You’ll never have to guess what to get for a housewarming gift now that you’re a part of the MacKenzie-Childs family. Our artisan-designed enamel pitchers and kitchenware pieces are the perfect gifts for any special people in your life. Since 1983, our talented designers and artisans have created beautiful original tableware, furniture, home and garden accessories, and more that add joy and grace to homes great and small throughout the world.Care instructions: Wipe clean with a soft damp cloth. If needed, hand-wash with mild soap and dry immediately. Do not microwave. Materials: Hand-glazed heavy-gauge steel underbody with hand-painted patterns; rimmed in bronzed stainless steel. Pieces may vary due to the handmade nature of each product. Imported. Our enamelware exceeds both federal food-safety regulations and California’s Proposition 65, the strictest environmental safety standards in the United States. Handle enamelware with care and discontinue use for food service if it becomes chipped, cracked, or broken. Dimensions: 4\" dia. x 5 1/4\" H (with lid); 10-ounce capacity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41wl8pQGnSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MACKENZIE-CHILDS","source_asin":"B0C5L8KXT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5L8KXT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5L8KXT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
