window.products.push({"id":746398,"name":"Optimus F-1610 16-Inch Oscillating 3-Speed Table Fan, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717itLXZsBL._AC_SL1331_.jpg","description":"Optimus 16 inch oscillating 3 blade table fan includes 3-speed adjustments for energy savings and a whisper quiet motor when in operation. 4 position piano key switch: Off, Lo, Med and Hi located on the base of the fan. Includes adjustable tilt and angle head for vertical settings. Provides full room 90-degree oscillation for excellent coverage. No tool assembly required and the powder coated safety grill is easily removable for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717itLXZsBL._AC_SL1331_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Optimus","source_asin":"B003H4PZYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003H4PZYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003H4PZYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":746399,"name":"Guzzini GU-2688.00-00 Love Picks for Appetizers, 4-Inch, Clear, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51so7e0AmHL._AC_SL1118_.jpg","description":"The Love 4-inch height set of picks for appetizers in clear, from Guzzini. Guzzini products can be found in homes, restaurants and hotels in 85 countries throughout the world. Much of this success is due to a basic quality in the company's DNA - a curiosity for innovation. A constant striving to achieve an ideal combination of practicality and aesthetic appeal has always encouraged Guzzini to explore inquisitively, both in researching new materials and finding interesting and original design concepts. The result is a vast catalog full of all types of items for the table, the kitchen and the home. They are all beautifully designed but easy to use, very familiar, inexpensive and extremely practical. Guzzini's motto is \"designed to be used\", and this is actually the case. Guzzini colanders, containers and cutlery are not designed to be kept religiously in drawers or cupboards and only brought out on special occasions. They are to be used and re-used for daily pleasure, so that every so often you suddenly realize that you have a well-designed item in your home that makes daily living a little easier. Therefore, Guzzini's research is aimed at quality of daily life, making every moment of the day special. This quality of life also includes an appropriate relationship between the items with which we surround ourselves and their impact on the environment. Fratelli Guzzini are dedicating much effort in this regard, and will continue to do so in the future, being aware that every product should be designed keeping a sharp eye on its environmental cost. Guzzini thermoplastics can be recycled and re-used over and over again, being reborn with new shapes and colours for new uses. They become more appealing and more useful than before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51so7e0AmHL._AC_SL1118_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Guzzini","source_asin":"B005SQ3JAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746399","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005SQ3JAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005SQ3JAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
