window.products.push({"id":746437,"name":"Premium Reusable Drinking Straws -Stainless Steel - Durable BPA-Free Alternative to Plastic Straws - Set of 12 with 2 Cleaning Brushes - For Smoothies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-0idTsmvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Reusable Drinking Straws Eco friendly & cool! This set contains 12 stainless steel drinking straws that are reusable. A stylish and durable BPA-free alternative to plastic straws. Three 8.5 inch and two 10.5 inch straight straws (Ø 0.24 inch), three 8.5 inch and two 10.5 inch bent straws (Ø 0.24 inch), one extra wide 10.5 inch straight straw (Ø 0.37 inch) for thick smoothies and milkshakes, one 8 inch stirring spoon straw (Ø 0.24 inch) and two cleaning brushes. Your drink will not only taste great, it will also look very cool! Great for cocktails, soft drinks, smoothies, milkshakes and juices. Perfect for stainless steel drinking cups and bottles, like Yeti Rambler Tumbler (20 + 30 oz). Never use plastic drinking straws anymore! Contribute to a cleaner world. Using durable, reusable products reduces waste and pollution. There are 2 cleaning brushes included that you can use to clean the inside of the stainless steel drinking straws. The straws can also be safely used in your dishwasher. Contents: - 3x 8.5 inch straight straw (Ø 0.24 inch) - 2x 10.5 inch straight straw (Ø 0.24 inch) - 3x 8.5 inch straight straw (Ø 0.24 inch) - 2x 10.5 inch straight straw(Ø 0.24 inch) - 1x 10.5 inch straight straw, extra wide (Ø 0.37 inch) - 1x 8 inch stirring spoon straw (Ø 0.24 inch) - 2x cleaning brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-0idTsmvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kare & Kind","source_asin":"B01GY2OSM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GY2OSM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GY2OSM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":746438,"name":"Villeroy & Boch Aureus Soup Plate, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oBpMLtaWL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Product Description Gone are the days of minimalism and purism-it's now all about luxury and opulence. With it's ornate pattern concept, Aureus unites classic and contemporary design trends. It appeals to modern sensibilities and is a timeless classic for the future. Amazon.com With a name meaning both \"gold\" and \"beautiful\" in Latin, the Aureus pattern from Villeroy & Boch creates a luminous table with a fresh feel. Its aqua and gold palette contrasts handsomely with white counterpoints and makes a lovely backdrop for the pattern's scatterings of bright flowers. Ideal for elegant dining without the stiff or minimalist feeling of many china lines, Aureus is opulent and spirited at once. Crafted from bone china with gold accents, it is also incredibly durable for frequent use and years of service. A pretty way to present pasta courses and bisques, this Aureus bowl combines a shallow inset center with a broad rim. A repeating border of intricate gold motifs on an aqua background creates the visual frame, while a handful of vivid blossoms add an air of spontaneity. Made in Germany, the bowl coordinates with Aureus place settings and, because of its gold accents, should not go in the microwave. Washing by hand is recommended. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oBpMLtaWL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B000GX81WU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000GX81WU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000GX81WU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
