window.products.push({"id":746445,"name":"Bathroom Rugs Sets 2 Piece, Luxury Chenille Bath Mat Set, Soft Plush Anti-Slip Bath Rug + U-Shaped Toilet Mat. Microfiber Shaggy Carpet, Super Absorbe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJnC7h0hL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"EXTRA SOFT 2-PIECE BATH MAT SET: Cushion those cold bathrooms tiles with LuxUrux’s luxuriously soft 1’’ high after-Bathroom rugs set. Our mat is designed to fit around your commode and the other one is a versatile rectangle. Making it Perfect for master bathroom, kids bathroom, vanity, guest suite. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Birth Day & Etc. SUPER ABSORBENT AND FAST DRYING MATERIAL: The mats are made of thousands of individual microfiber High-pile, thick Chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the Shower, Bath, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the mat's 1'' deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly leaving the mat fresh, dry. !CAUTION: Place mat on DRY FLAT SURFACE only. Water under rug can cause it to slip. Always Keep bottom of rug dry BETTER & LONGER LASTING MATERIALS: The durable materials and high-quality construction ensure that it will not deteriorate, flatten or fall apart with use. Use every day, and wash regularly. This mat will look great, and stay functional for many years to come. Its Color will not fade. Color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried MACHINE WASHABLE: Both the chenille microfiber and the PVC layer used in the mat are designed to be machine washable to get stains out. unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. For best results, wash on cold and lightly tumble dry on low heat. GUARANTEE - Love it or your money back! Life time warranty by LuxUrux. If you are not satisfied with your rug or if you decide that this is not for you, then please do not hesitate and reach out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iJnC7h0hL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuxUrux","source_asin":"B07W5SK5NR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W5SK5NR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W5SK5NR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
