window.products.push({"id":746448,"name":"Poedist 4 Pcs Bathroom Shower Curtain Set, Red Rose Shower Curtain Valentine's Day Shower Curtain Sets with Rugs(Bath Mat,U Shape and Toilet Lid Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z3lpkKsIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bathroom set】This rose shower curtain set is made of environmentally friendly polyester fabric, which can make the water dry quickly and prevent water from splashing on the floor. The durable thick coral velvet bath mat is soft and comfortable, which can quickly absorb dripping water and help you keep it The floor is dry and tidy. It has no chemical smell and will never cause any harm to your family. 【Creative design】This lover rose shower curtain set adds charm to the bathroom. The enthusiastic rose pattern makes your bathroom instantly full of vitality and a sense of fashion. The shower curtain set uses high-definition pattern printing technology, rich in colors and vivid, Not easy to fade. Completely change your bathroom style and create a warm and comfortable bathroom experience. 【Good Sizes】Waterproof shower curtain size:71\"x71\" W, O shape toilet lid cover size: 18\"x16\"W, Non-slip flannel bathroom mat sizes: 29.5\" L X 18\" W, U shape rug sizes: 20\" L X 20\" W. This shower curtain set has been enlarged in size and thickened thickness, which is suitable for most family bathrooms 【Easy installation】We give 12 hooks for free. No need to worry about how to install it. 12 reinforced head grommets, simple suspension; weighted bottom hem to maintain perfect drape; toilet seat cushion has a durable elastic band for fixing; the floor mat has a unique bottom dotting non-slip design that is not easy to move, ensuring safety. You can use this rose shower curtain set to bring new life to your bathroom, walls, and windows. 【Precautions】Hand wash or machine wash hang to dry, and iron at low temperature. Please do not bleach. Due to the vacuum packaging, the product will have slight wrinkles after opening. You only need to let it stand for 12 hours after opening or wash and dry to restore its smoothness~ It is very suitable for families, motels, hotels, dormitories or bathtub. If you are dissatisfied with our products, you can contact our service, we will definitely solve your problem as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z3lpkKsIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Poedist","source_asin":"B0B5KZSCCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5KZSCCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5KZSCCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
