window.products.push({"id":746498,"name":"Aston & Arden Recycled Striped Turkish Bath Towels - (Set of 2) Soft & Absorbent Eco-Friendly Aegean Cotton Blend, 600 GSM, Decorative Towel for Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bqZJhz14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-FRIENDLY RECYCLED COTTON: Aegean towels are made with the finest long-staple virgin cotton from Turkey blended with 50% eco-friendly recycled cotton. The Global Recycled Standard (GRS) certification ensures that these towels are officially recycled blended textiles by the IDFL standards, as a global leader in quality assurance since 1978. Renew, relax, and restore with peace of mind knowing that this luxurious product was produced sustainably by the highest global standards. FINE TURKISH COTTON BLEND: The sunshine's warmth over the west coast of Turkey provides an extended growing season creating an ideal growing window for Aegean cotton crops. This region enjoys the perfect marriage of climate, topography, nutrient-rich soil, and location that results in the prestigious Aegean cotton we use in our towels. BOUTIQUE HOTEL STYLE: The Aegean Eco-Friendly Recycled Cotton Bath Towel Collection design includes a six-color stripe-on-white palette, a low-twist weave, oversized bath sheets, extra strong hems, and a unique textured woven stripe border. Pair these gorgeous stripe-on-white bath towels with their solid color sister collection designed with exact-match solid colors. COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: The Aegean Collection was inspired by a stunning region of Turkey for its rich earth tones. Colors include subtle shades of frosted green, weathered grey, shale grey, deep pool blue, and wheat beige. Make a sophisticated decor statement with distinguished bathroom towels from Aston & Arden's Aegean collection. RING SPUN ECO-FRIENDLY RECYCLED COTTON: Ring spun virgin cotton fibers (long-staple cotton) are spun and stretched, creating finer, softer yarn. When eco-friendly recycled cotton fibers (from high-quality recycled new remnants) are blended and spun together with virgin cotton, the result is undetectable as recycled. When woven into towels the result is a superior quality plush textile that rivals the best towels on the market today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bqZJhz14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BLTCJYTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLTCJYTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLTCJYTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
