window.products.push({"id":746583,"name":"Arctic Dreams 10\" Hybrid Cooling Gel Mattress with Quick Response Gel Infused Memory Foam, Made in The USA, Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":464.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bQHm98iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a cooler and more comfortable nights sleep with our Arctic Dreams 10\" Hybrid Cooling Gel Mattress with Quick Response Gel Infused Memory Foam. The Arctic Dreams Hybrid mattress features extraordinary value at a price you will love. As a hybrid, it will minimize sleep distrubance through the use of individual pocketed coils, while cradling the sleeper in the comfort of our quick respone gel infused memory foam. The Arctic Dreams 10\" Hybrid Cooling Gel Mattress with Quick Response Gel Infused Memory Foam is engineered with up to 1024 individually pocketed coils for better reactivity, pressure point relief and motion isolation. This mattress features 1\" of high quality base foam, 6\" of individually pocketed coils and is topped with 2.5\" of our Energex Gel Infused Memory Foam. A .5\" of soft quilting material completes the mattress. Although this mattress is not cool to the touch, it will help regulate your body temperature throughout the night Put this all together and you have an unparalleled combination of comfort and support to give you a great night's sleep. Please allow up to 24 hours for your mattress to fully expand and any potential odors to dissipate.Our Dreamfoam mattresses are made in our local USA factory, using the highest quality materials. Our personal approach to designing, stitching and crafting backed by a generous 10-year no hassle warranty. Certi-PUR Certified, which means that our mattress is made without ozone depleters, PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (\"Tris\") flame retardants, mercury, lead, heavy metals, formaldehyde or phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bQHm98iVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamfoam Bedding","source_asin":"B07WVWJH88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WVWJH88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WVWJH88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
