window.products.push({"id":746646,"name":"Wax & Wane Twig & Moss Modern Candle - 8 Oz Soy Candles Gifts For Home Décor, 40+ Hours Long Lasting Scented Candles Hand Made In The USA From 100% Na","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqUypbpgS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEEL THE SPARKLE OF THE CASCADE MOUNTAINS Inspired by the west side of the Cascade mountain range, you will instantly be transported to the lush forests of oak moss, ferns, and lichens. With a subtle woody scent together with warmth of moss and amber, you’ll bring the calm and magic of nature right to your home.We find inspiration in natural beauty- long hikes in the woods, the smell of the first snow of winter, the breeze at a rugged coast. Many of our scents are inspired by our travels, experiences, and memories. WHAT MAKES TWIG & MOSS SCENTED CANDLE SPECIAL? ✅ MODERN DESIGN WITH LID -Our jar candles with their modern jar design and gold lid are a great addition to any room.✅ STRONG FRAGRANCE -We use premium fragrances and essential oils that are vegan, cruelty free, while still able to fill any room with their strong scents.✅ PERFECT SIZE -A classic 8 oz candle that is perfect size. It can be used in your bathroom, kitchen, living room, or any room in need of a great scent.✅ LONGER BURN TIME -With 40 to 50 hours of burn time our long lasting scented candles also come with lids to protect your candles between burns✅ MADE IN USA -Each handmade candle is lovingly hand poured in small batches from soy wax derived from 100% American grown soybeans. All candles are hand-poured (with love) in Bend, Oregon. WHY CHOOSE US? Because we believe in creating the very best candles using NATURAL INGREDIENTS and still being ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY With a passion for creating eco-conscious and premium scented candles, every candle is hand-poured and mixed in small batches of just eight to ensure quality and attention to detail. Our scents are carefully curated and always phthalate-free. We believe in using healthy and environmentally friendly ingredients. All of our candles are vegan and fragrances are never tested on animals.CHECK our store for other premium soy candles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gqUypbpgS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wax & Wane Candles","source_asin":"B07SCV5PN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746646","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SCV5PN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SCV5PN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
