window.products.push({"id":746881,"name":"Fowooyeen Rug Pads Grippers, 4 Pcs Non-Slip Rug Gripper for Hardwood Floors and Tiles, Reusable and Washable Rug Tape Carpet Tape for Area Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m9LiaeWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of constantly adjusting your rugs or worried about slips and falls? Our non-slip rug grip tape and pads are the perfect solution! Fowooyeen rug gripper is made with safe and harmless silicone material that is designed to last, our rug grip tape and pads are a reliable solution for keeping your rugs in place. How Does It Work: Fowooyeen rug gripper can be easily adsorbed between the floor and the rug, there are 9 suction holes on the side facing the rug, using advanced adsorption technology, whenever the pressure is increased on the rug, the air in the suction holes will decrease, they create a strong grip between your rugs and any smooth surface, preventing slips and protecting your floors. Recycling and Eco-Friendly: When your rug or rug gripper is dirty, you can always put the rug gripper and the rug into the washing machine for cleaning together, or rinse the rug gripper directly with water, and after the rug gripper is dried, it will resume its function. Versatile Use: No residue and damaged floor, Suitable for use with any type of rug and any smooth surface, including hardwood, tile, and laminate flooring. Rug grip tape and pads are essential items for anyone who wants to keep their rugs in place and prevent accidents caused by slipping or tripping. With our Rug Grip Tape & Pads, you can ensure your rugs stay in place and provide a safe and stable surface for your home or office. Don't let slippery rugs cause accidents - order yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m9LiaeWFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fowooyeen","source_asin":"B0BZHZ8QRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZHZ8QRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZHZ8QRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
