window.products.push({"id":746895,"name":"180ml Oil Sprayer Glass Oil Dispenser Bottle Spray Lemon Juice Sprayer for Cooking, Salad, Baking，Cleaning, Plants(White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N8j9++qIS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Description:Perfect quality: The oil spray cap is made of PP, and the bottle is made of glass. This edible cooking oil sprayer is great for barbecue use and it is durable, smooth, simple and beautiful.Easy to use: the sprayer has a capacity of 180ml. Just click on the pressure pump to create small and regular sprays that can precisely control the spices (wine / soy sauce / wine) and enjoy the pleasure of cooking.Food Selection in Fat: The olive oil sprayer even provides a pure oil mist. Just use this oil sprayer to save your oil when cooking, salad, baking, etc.Versatile oil sprayer: The essential oil sprayer is a container for olive oil, sunflower oil, soy sauce, vinegar and lemon juice. Practical kitchen accessory.Easy to clean: The oil dispenser consists of a bottle cap and a bottle. Shake evenly when using, then press the button to spray the oil so that you can look and taste better. When cleaning, pour hot water and neutral detergent, tighten the cap, shake the bottle, press the button, press the sprayer, clean the straw and nozzle and directly our water from the bottle.Specifications:Product name: SprayerColor: White, Pink, BlueMaterial: PP+glassSize:Bottom diameter: About 63mm/2.5inchHeight: About 168mm/6.6inchPackage Includes:1Pc* Sprayer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N8j9++qIS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saycker","source_asin":"B09GK6LXPY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GK6LXPY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GK6LXPY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
