window.products.push({"id":746903,"name":"Gorgeous Home LINEN 100% Mulberry Silk Duvet Cover Set- 3 Pieces - 22 Momme 6A Graded Mulberry Silk Set King (76 inch X80 inch ) Black Solid - with Zi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i9pkeT2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabric: 100% 22 Momme pure Mulberry silk. Thread Count: 400 Closure: Hidden zip closure at the upper part of the duvet cover. Corner Ties: 4 corner ties to help keep the inner comforter in place. Colors Available: Black, White, Ivory, Coffee, Silver gray, Taupe, Gold, Chocolate, Light Blue, Pale Turquoise, Royal Blue, Blue, Violet. Care Instructions: - Machine-washable in lukewarm water (30°C) on most gentle cycle available. - Minimize spin time. - Hang dry if possible. - Tumble dry on a cool setting if using drying machine. Avoid drying for extended period of time. - Iron when slightly damp using a cool setting. Always iron on the inside. - Keep out of touch of pets/sharp objects. Our 22 Momme line of seamless silk duvet covers are made from 100% Grade A mulberry silk. The seamless duvet cover is the structurally stronger alternative to the seamed version. Like its seamed counterpart, it is the perfect choice to start your experience with high-end luxury silk with a great value/cost ratio. The seamless duvet cover is directly cut from a whole piece of silk fabric and thus does not have any seams in its material. This helps with the duvet cover’s integrity and contributes to its longer shelf-life. Wonderfully cool in the summer and not overly warm in winter, our silk duvet covers are your ideal solution to any tossing and turning problems you may have at night. Always wake up refreshed and you will soon see the difference a good night’s sleep makes on your overall health! Size Chart:Single?140x200cm?Double,200x200cm?King?225x220cm?Super King?260x220cm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i9pkeT2QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorgeous Home LINEN","source_asin":"B09SVR38QV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SVR38QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SVR38QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
