window.products.push({"id":746921,"name":"OTOTO Pasta Monsters and Salad Servers - BPA-Free Fun Kitchen Gadgets - 100% Food Safe Salad Spoon and Fork Set - Pasta and Salad Server - 11.93x 3.39","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Z4Yse8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Monster Servers- Having spaghetti for dinner? Or perhaps some leafy greens? Made by the design awarded OTOTO Studio, Pasta Monsters, the salad spoon and fork duo are ready to swoop and serve at your command. This salad spoon and fork set are highly durable and dishwasher safe. Aside from being adorable, these utensil servers are absolute must-haves for mealtimes. Made from 100% Food safe and BPA-free material, you can't go wrong with these googly-eyed salad spoons! A 'pasta'-tively amazing gift- Looking for new home gift ideas for your friends and family? Housewarming gifts? Give your loved ones a special surprise with these not-so-scary pasta and salad serving utensils. OTOTO's kitchen tools and gadgets are best sellers for a reason. Why? More than just novelty items, our designs are multi-use, super sturdy, have a comfort grip, and are free of harmful plastics! What are you waiting for? Keep things extra saucy with this 'pasta'-tively awesome treat! Nifty Kitchen Critters- Meal teams are always tons of fun when you're with these friendly kitchen critters! Made from food-grade plastic, they scoop up your freshly cooked pasta effortlessly, with no spills. Don't let their looks deceive you, these kitchen beasts make incredible kitchen essentials. Other than pasta and salads, you can use these monstrous serving utensils for other homemade dishes like soups, curries, and more. These funny kitchen gadgets won't disappoint! Come and 'Spaghet-it'-Looking for durable, lightweight, and BPA-free pasta and salad utensils for serving? 'Sauce'-picious about our Pasta Monsters set? OTOTO's multi-purpose pasta and salad servers would be a great addition to your kitchen! Aside from serving plates of pasta, these friendly critters can serve up salads, soups, and more. What are you waiting for? The 'pasta'-bilities are endless with our fun kitchen gadgets! A Sprinkle of Fun - Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Z4Yse8oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B0BSV8PWMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-746921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSV8PWMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSV8PWMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
